; Behaviour block: a water drop (kind 9, rooms 15 and 19)
;
; Used by the drops that fall from the roof of Gloomy tunels and Underground river (cyan, attribute $45). This kind does
; not have the layout of #R$93D3: after the 5 header bytes (same meaning as there) come the attribute and the sprite
; height (read by #R$B56D), then sprite addresses and 3-byte entries (attribute, sprite address) that #R$B56D indexes by the
; animation step. What each entry is (falling drop, splash on the ground) was not worked out: Unknown.
@label=BehaviourDrop
b$94E3 DEFB $00,$03,$03,$05,$02  ; hit box top, left, bottom, right (2-pixel units); slot +$15 (Unknown)
 $94E8 DEFB $45,$04  ; attribute, sprite height
 $94EA DEFW $EF53    ; sprite $EF53
 $94EC DEFW $EF55    ; sprite $EF55
 $94EE DEFW $F357    ; sprite $F357
 $94F0 DEFB $44      ; 3-byte entries: attribute,
 $94F1 DEFW $EF30    ; sprite $EF30
 $94F3 DEFB $43      ; attribute
 $94F4 DEFW $EF30    ; sprite $EF30
 $94F6 DEFB $44      ; attribute
 $94F7 DEFW $EF32    ; sprite $EF32
 $94F9 DEFB $47      ; attribute
 $94FA DEFW $EF34    ; sprite $EF34
 $94FC DEFB $47      ; attribute
 $94FD DEFW $EF36    ; sprite $EF36
 $94FF DEFB $45      ; attribute
 $9500 DEFW $F759    ; sprite $F759
 $9502 DEFW $F75B    ; sprite $F75B
 $9504 DEFW $F75D    ; sprite $F75D
